{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_03_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_03","title":"早芒种","storyCode":"HS-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"19986e5c21a61c04eb4f4633cb3a8764216daf03f4495c1ecde6941a290632e1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"年和夕因突然回到大荒城的兄长而感到不安。禾生和小满在田间遇到了一个自称久未归乡的商人。商人大方地表示，可以卖给二人一个“愿望”。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"姐姐。\n我跟着那位先生远走，才发现原来外面的天地和这大荒城大不相同。我们留在这里短短几十年，人类又琢磨出不少新奇玩意。\n炎国大地上还有各式各样的城市，除了望不到头的农田，还有华丽的宫殿，热闹的集市，样样有趣。\n我回来歇歇就走。这一趟还是出远门，不知道多少年才能回来。\n说起来，这大荒城也不是早些年艰苦的时候，能照料这片田地的人多得是，你真的不打算和我一起出去看看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......姐姐，我发现，原来外面的大地与这大荒城也没有什么不同。\n是啊。又走了几十年，还是百来年？想法总是会变的。\n见得多了，发现原来不论走到哪里，人到底只是人，这人间好像没什么意思......人心叵测，但其实也不难猜。\n嗯。先生死前说的话，我吃透了。\n姐姐......你还打算留在这里多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么好不容易把你从那座山头揪出来，还是这么自闭？既然现在黍也不在，和我出去转转咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里没什么新奇玩意，但是果蔬粮食的味道还真是移动城市的种植地块比不了的。对了，你是不是还从来没见过粮食是怎么酿成酒的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天师府是不是又来找你麻烦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕天师府什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有这功夫，你应该为外面一动不动的大家伙想想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天师们都去救灾了，我一个人能有什么办法，又不能亲自上手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好无聊啊！还是让我看看，你今天画的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么小气嘛，没灵感的话我还能给你出出主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我，出去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g5_factory_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么紧张？看来是真的有秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是秘密，是烦心事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天师府里的老家伙们是挺烦的，但其实奈何不了你什么。而且都有朝廷替我们打包票了，他们最多唠叨你几句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你在烦......“他”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感觉到他已经到了，从不藏掖的。我们怎么说也是一家人，不去看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么生疏啊......我听说他每次路过你的山头，都会带些搜罗来的当世最好的画作送你的，你可别嘴硬说你不喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你上次见他，是什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，还真记不清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他手中的生意做得太大，被司岁台提醒了好几次，之后好像收敛了一点。最近几年就只是游山玩水，把炎国每座城市都挨个转了个遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可司岁台盯他比盯我们要严密得多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道得这么清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和司岁台打交道的时候，偷偷瞄了两眼他们的记事本——藏得没那么深的那部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生意做得太大”。我怎么记得，他不过只是个喜欢养蚕种桑，跟在黍身边的小呆子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近一次见他的时候——就是你所谓的“路过”那时——我从画里探过一两眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那眼神，浑，讨厌，和那个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——和臭棋篓子一样，我懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且臭棋篓子越狱那年，他人就在百灶。你以为这几年大炎对你我不闻不问，都主要盯着谁呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得他俩勾搭上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不晓得。我还以为臭棋篓子只和令姐大哥关系好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是司岁台做下了这种判断，他也不可能像现在这样到处串门了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是不知道他有多会做“人”，年年定期给司岁台上交的账本，每一笔生意、每一文的收支都记得明明白白，挑不出半点毛病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论哪里的城市遇上天灾受了损失，他自掏腰包赈灾的速度比谁都快。就是看在这一点上，司岁台再怎么说也得留几分情面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得他有几分好心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底也是我们的兄弟......我还能背后说他坏话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种事你少干了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况人间本就不存在我们这样的关系。“兄弟姐妹”......我倒是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚。别凑过来。也别趁机偷看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，别动手，别急。唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“兄弟姐妹”。毕竟世俗意义上的骨肉亲情对我们来说并不成立......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能几百年后，炎国的史官会专门发明一个词来形容我们这样的关系......或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你这嘴硬的别扭性子要是能改改，我们还能多搞几次家庭聚会来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么时候嘴硬过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，你什么时候才愿意让我看看，你书房里的那十二幅画？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没错，是十二幅。哪怕是三姐消失后，你也一直留着她那一幅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——画上的那些人究竟是谁，想明白了吗？还是不愿意再想了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总不能......连你的自画像......至今都还是无从下笔吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非要这么拧巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"一场暴雨。\n天上的灰云已经散了，空气中还能闻到湿润的气味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左乐看到禾生咬了咬牙，按下了手中天师仪的开关。\n紧接着，一种他没有见过的大型载具碾过田地，一排排的庄稼跟着倒了下去。\n风刮过断了根而枯黄的阔大的叶，发出止不住的响声。像是傲慢的嗤笑——\n灾害说来就来，说走就走。\n人能奈这片天如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些作物就是要放弃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片地是我的第一块试验田，原本种的都是玉米。它们全都被含源石的污水浸过了，只能处理掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一块地一旦被源石污染过，恢复起来异常困难。所以这片大地很辽阔，但是能用来耕作的土地却少之又少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉米连芯子都是甜的，我小时候刚来大荒城第一次尝，觉得它是最好吃的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想让它好好地长在土里，让所有人都能尝到它的甜味，像我第一次吃时那样开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"发动机声隆隆作响，只留下一片光秃秃的土地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾——终于找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走快走，工程他们轧了一片田，职农大叔和天师们吵起来了，你快去看看吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，灾害刚过，物资短缺，时间紧任务重，我们的工程耽误不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些田已经是决定要废弃了，各位就让条道，让我们把这些工具搬过去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“废”？俩嘴唇一碰就开始胡说！这里种田的天师前两天才告诉过我，庄稼研究到了最关键的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们开着载具直接从我们田上碾过去，谁给你们的权力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“丁卯号地块泥土样本检测到过量源石颗粒浓度”，这个意思就是说这片田已经被污染了，已经废——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的灾年年都有，怎么你们这些外面的人来了，这土地在你们嘴里就成了废地了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这田地又没法挪，几场灾下来已经被污染了，不救田也是上面的决定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年已经是荒年，不救田可是要闹荒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是不是没见过早些年大批大批饿死人的时候？！轻飘飘一句话，说先工程就先工程，不仅不帮着救土地还轧了过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城可是我们的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说的这都是什么道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老天爷的道理！你大爷的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的土木天师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你大爷的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大爷的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔阿姨们，你们别打架呀......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——这田......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看！这地刚被源石毁过一次，还没来得及救，他们这些人开着载具又来轧一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一说话就搬出什么侍郎什么报告，谁认你那个侍郎？那人我见都没见过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位天师，我们似乎并没有收到任何有关废弃这片田地的通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得之前应该已经决定了，优先抢救土地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还没有听说？工程物资的补给已经到位了。大荒城的改建昨天晚上就恢复动工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据最新的土地受损检查结果，也重新评估了修复土地需要的成本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得出的结论是，要放弃大荒城外围农田地块的改建，优先保障核心城的建设......而且，要做好随时移动核心城的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前土地的污染源研究清楚了吗？为什么急着下这样的判断？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天师府......更上层得出的结论。你要是不信，也可以去找资深天师确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生回过头看了看，几位职农怔怔望着被履带碾过的田垄，神色黯然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几位前辈，如果最终天师府得出了要放弃田地的结论，我们都会听从安排的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是这些田，不仅是这里的大家干活的地方，也是人们的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然还没有正式通知大家搬离。至少现在，恳请你们先把这些工程器械挪到别的地方去，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我答应你。不过也就这几天的时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你们年年守在这里耕种是辛苦，但是情况不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去没有移动城市的时候，人们确实离不开这片地，可是现在的庄稼都搬上移动地块发展无土栽培了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，大荒城这片地也没有什么特殊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说要在这里研究有源石耐受性的庄稼，可是这么多年过去了，不也没什么结果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g11_shuresearchoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不确定......如果最终只能得到这个结果，“万顷”这项研究，根本没有推广应用的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么多年了，别说成果，一点希望的苗头都看不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤愤不平的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，你和那些人说什么了，他们就走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯......最近，大家还是抓紧收拾田地吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大水牛？大水牛！你到底在发什么呆呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在要怎么办？听那些天师的意思，大荒城真的要搬走？这些田都要抛下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乡长奶奶不知道在哪里，我们要不要去找她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说话呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大荒城有这样的变动，她应该是第一个知道的。她没有站出来，说明她也没有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更没有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又说什么丧气话呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，当年的神农，会不会真的是个神仙啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的话，她是怎么能在那么艰苦的环境里，开辟出这么一片土地的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神农是很厉害，可是现在的人们能把这片土地照顾好也很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是随随便便就说放弃了，神农才要狠狠骂你呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满感觉脚下踩到了什么东西，慌慌张张收回了脚。稻谷晃了晃，一个人影直起身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾下午睡的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，扰人清梦啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正梦到稻谷丰收，突然一场天灾，生生把这场好梦给砸醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！你这人怎么在田里睡觉啊，不怕别人踩到你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是已经狠狠地踩到了我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还不是因为你躺得不是地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！这位先生，您没有伤到哪里吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤倒是没伤，可是这好好的衣服上踩了这么大一个泥脚印，实在是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是你......睡觉不看地方的大叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走路不看路的小丫头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小满......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你说怎么办嘛！我帮你洗干净，还是赔你一件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，我身上的物件都是走南闯北搜罗来的最精贵的东西，交给你洗，最后只会收到一团乱麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......您就是为大荒城带来救灾物资的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是机灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是个商人，早些年做生意攒下了一些本钱，听闻大荒城遇上了灾害就赶了回来，故乡有难，自然是要尽己所能帮一帮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是大荒城的人？你为什么会在田地里睡觉？你在这里没有家吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太久没有回来，这里风景都变了模样，没想到就迷了路......正好想问问，你们知道看影子戏的地方怎么走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“影子戏”？那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用秸秆编出花样，用布蒙着灯，照出花样的影子演戏"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你们现在已经不看影子戏了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没看到过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你们如今庆祝丰收的地方在哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说大戏台吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我知道，你顺着这条路走，看到第三棵大树，再左转就是啦，其实就在神农祠的后面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......神农祠倒是还在。不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢，你是第一个愿意给我指路的人，也算和你有缘。卖你一个愿望，什么都行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人伸出手，掌心躺着一枚圆润的石子，盈盈地摇晃着光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个愿望，什么都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信，你是商人，又不是神仙，难道我和你说了，它就真能实现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确只是一名商人，不过生意做得大一点，什么都能买，什么都能卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但能和我做生意的机会不是人人都有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的？"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满回头看了一眼站在身后的小禾，仔细想了想，又看回面前的男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我希望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我希望大荒城年年丰收，岁岁平安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，这个愿望我卖给你了，那对应的，你要拿什么来买呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小满......这个人看上去很奇怪，我们还是走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有什么值钱的东西，你可别想骗我的钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不用多么贵重，只要是你喜欢的、看重的物件，都可以拿来交换。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾！我可以吹那首曲子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曲子？......哪首曲子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满一噘嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真是个笨水牛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处，几只羽兽停在牧兽的背上，用它们长长的喙捉走牧兽身上的小虫。\n牧兽闷着头吃草，羽兽蹦蹦跳跳，偶尔伸直脖颈，发出几声愉悦婉转的鸣声。\n小满横起自己的笛子，放到嘴边。\n风轻轻地伴奏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"山青青呀水悠悠，月光洒在河上慢慢流♪\n小船小船摇又晃，我种下种子等花放♪\n星星挂在天空不说话，外面飘来的种子发芽啦♪\n你坐上小船去远方，稻花儿飘飘落手旁♪\n飘呀，飘呀，我送你去远方♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不错的报酬，我很喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这颗石头是你的了，你的愿望会实现的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满放下笛子，瞪了旁边的小禾一眼，跺跺脚跑走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘看起来在生气啊，这是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这首曲子是她给我编的，三年前她送我去考校的时候吹给我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我记得的，只是刚刚没反应过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，有这份心意，倒是难得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你有没有什么想要和我买的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢您，但我现在没有什么特别想要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者说我想要的，也不可能靠买来得到，还是需要我自己去做才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不妨说来听听？在下也别无所长，只是去过的地方格外多，能卖的东西也格外多些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么都能卖，那你难道能卖我一个能喂饱天下人的未来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......什么意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"货物越精贵要价当然也越高，你的宏伟理想，你打算用什么价钱来买呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，剩下那些污染的庄稼我已经收拾了，你看还需要我做——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着华丽的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位公子为何这么盯着我？难道是与在下认识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借一步说话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
